## IV.2 The Upgraded Unit — Proof-Carrying Claim (13 Fields)

### Core Structure (▲ — from Audit #1 §6, incorporating Audit #3's additions)

Each unit contains:

| # | Field | Required Content | Origin |
|---|---|---|---|
